# Content Script Rules

## DOM Interaction

- Only modify LinkedIn DOM on user-initiated actions (search update, see-more clicks)
- Do not inject CSS into LinkedIn pages
- Mark clicked buttons with `data-clicked="true"` to prevent duplicate clicks
- Use `textContent` over `innerHTML` when reading page text

## Selectors

Centralize new selectors at the top of the file. Current selectors:

- Search: `.search-global-typeahead__input`
- Expand: `button.see-more`, `button[aria-label*="see more"]`
- Extract: `a[href^="mailto:"]`, `document.body.innerText`

Update `docs/CONTENT_SCRIPT.md` when adding or changing selectors.

## Extraction

- Normalize emails to lowercase before storage
- Validate with `isValidEmail()` before adding to results
- Apply `shouldExclude()` filter before returning
- Sort results alphabetically

## Scroll and Extract

- Scroll interval controlled by `scrollSpeed` (ms)
- Scroll target: `main` element, fallback `document.documentElement`
- Wait 2000ms after final scroll before extraction
- Persist `cachedEmails` only when `includeUnique` is true
